New Business
15. Recognition of Planning Commissioner Mark Smith
24 - 579
Mark Smith has resigned from the Planning Commission effective today. Justin
Arnold, Planning Manager, commended Mark on his commitment and dedication to
the Planning Commission and his many years of volunteering for numerous community
boards and committees.
Adjournment
There being no further business the meeting was adjourned at 3:48 p.m.
